    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>奇物，非普通</em> <br />這副牌的牌組有着閃閃發光的邊緣。持握此牌組期間，你可以使用其以下能力： <br /><strong>致命發牌Deadly Deal。</strong>以一個動作，你可以通過從中投擲一枚靈體卡牌用於發動遠程法術攻擊，攻擊檢定中使用敏捷調整值。該卡牌具有120尺的射程，在命中時造成[[/damage 1d8 type=force]]傷害。 <br /><strong>卡牌噴射Spray of Cards。</strong>以一個動作，你洗切牌組並用其施展3環版本的法術 <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.QeeoKnO9JbeAkvQz]{卡牌噴射 Spray of Cards}</em>（法術豁免DC 15；詳見第七章的法術部分）。一旦此牌組被用於施展這一法術，直到次日黎明後才能再次用於施展該法術。</p><p>The cards of this deck shimmer around the edges. While holding this deck, you can use the following properties:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deadly Deal\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Deadly Deal.</span> As an action, you can use this deck to make a ranged spell attack by throwing a spectral card and using Dexterity for the attack roll. The card has a range of 120 feet and deals [[/damage 1d8 type=force]] damage on a hit.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Spray of Cards\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Spray of Cards.</span> As an action, you can shuffle the deck and cast the @spell[Spray of Cards|BMT] spell at 3rd level from the deck (spell save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>). Once the deck has cast the spell, it can't cast the spell again until the next dawn.</p></li></ul></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
